{
  "declaredLength": 5200,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cuántas veces me vas a hacer repetírtelo, eh,\nmerluzo?! ¡Que mi Arbok es el más fuerte!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, ¡qué mieeedo! ¿Qué va a hacer, restregarme\nlos dibujitos esos del vientre por la cara?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Venga, hombre! Ni punto de comparación\ncon Glalie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eh! ¿Y a ti qué te pasa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004500680021002000BF00590020006100200074006900200071007500E900200074006500200070006100730061003F001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mira, ya que estás, ven y ayúdanos a resolver\nesto de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900720061002C0020007900610020007100750065002000650073007400E10073002C002000760065006E0020007900200061007900FA00640061006E006F0073002000610020007200650073006F006C007600650072000A006500730074006F00200064006500200075006E0061002000760065007A0021001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo único que tienes que hacer es enfrentarte\na nosotros en un combate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Iré yo primero. Lucha contra mi Arbok\nen un uno contra uno.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007200E900200079006F0020007000720069006D00650072006F002E0020004C007500630068006100200063006F006E0074007200610020006D00690020004100720062006F006B000A0065006E00200075006E00200075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F002E001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y luego ya te enfrentas al Glalie de este,\ntambién en un uno contra uno.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAunque ya te aviso de que es un paquete...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿A quién llamas paquete, desgraciao?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMira, lucha contra los dos, ¡así le quedará claro\nque mi Pokémon le da mil vueltas al suyo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfréntate a mi Arbok para callarle la boca\nal payaso este. ¡En un uno contra uno!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, si vas a perder",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E00670061002C00200073006900200076006100730020006100200070006500720064006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me tengo que preparar antes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006E0067006F002000710075006500200070007200650070006100720061007200200061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pues date prisa! Elige al Pokémon que más\nte guste y ya.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000750065007300200064006100740065002000700072006900730061002100200045006C00690067006500200061006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200071007500650020006D00E10073000A0074006500200067007500730074006500200079002000790061002E001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh, ¡que yo voy a luchar solo con Arbok!\nNo es justo si tú llevas más de un Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Serás insolente! Te voy a hacer morder el polvo\ntan rápido que ni lo verás venir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dale una buena lección al pesao este, anda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006C006500200075006E00610020006200750065006E00610020006C006500630063006900F3006E00200061006C00200070006500730061006F00200065007300740065002C00200061006E00640061002E001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi Arbok ha... ¿perdido?...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00690020004100720062006F006B002000680061002E002E002E002000BF007000650072006400690064006F003F002E002E002E001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ea, por bocachancla! ¿Ves como tu Arbok\nes un blandengue? ¡Mi Glalie es mejor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, ahora nos toca a nosotros.\n¡Acabemos con esto rapidito y pa casa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te toca enfrentarte a mi Glalie en un uno contra\nuno. ¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ti también te haré morder el polvo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000740069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002000740065002000680061007200E90020006D006F007200640065007200200065006C00200070006F006C0076006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me tengo que preparar antes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006E0067006F002000710075006500200070007200650070006100720061007200200061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te has achantao al final, ¿eh? Si es que está claro\nque ningún Pokémon le puede.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero vamos a ver, ¿qué parte de \"uno contra uno\"\nno entiendes?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002000760061006D006F0073002000610020007600650072002C002000BF0071007500E9002000700061007200740065002000640065002000220075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F0022000A006E006F00200065006E007400690065006E006400650073003F001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te vas a enterar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006500200076006100730020006100200065006E007400650072006100720021001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Buah... ¿Pero a ti qué te dan de comer, si se puede\nsaber?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500610068002E002E002E002000BF005000650072006F0020006100200074006900200071007500E9002000740065002000640061006E00200064006500200063006F006D00650072002C002000730069002000730065002000700075006500640065000A00730061006200650072003F001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que se ha cepillao a mi Glalie también...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006500200073006500200068006100200063006500700069006C006C0061006F002000610020006D006900200047006C0061006C00690065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E002E002E001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ea, por listillo. ¡Nos ha dado pa'l pelo a los dos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450061002C00200070006F00720020006C0069007300740069006C006C006F002E002000A1004E006F00730020006800610020006400610064006F0020007000610027006C002000700065006C006F002000610020006C006F007300200064006F00730021001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo que viene a significar... ¿qué? Que ni mi Arbok\nni tu Glalie son los más fuertes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Es verdad! ¡Tu <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002> es el más fuerte\nde todos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000A10045007300200076006500720064006100640021002000A1005400750020001000020101000200200065007300200065006C0020006D00E100730020006600750065007200740065000A0064006500200074006F0064006F00730021001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se ve que se nos ha ido la fuerza por la boca...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo podríamos con <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂélella ni cuando los Froakie\ncríen pelo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me has abierto los ojos. Ya sé lo que quiero hacer\ncon mi vida. Lo veo claramente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo también!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Ahora tengo más claro que nunca que no dejaré\nque el cenutrio este me supere!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Que te lo has creío tú, mendrugo!\n¡Te va a tocar enfrentarte a mí toda la vida!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    }
  ],
